  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tuna pasta bake is a store-cupboard supper built on tinned tuna, tinned sweetcorn, and a quick cheese sauce. The pasta goes into the oven coated in a thick "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "bechamel",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "bechamel"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " loaded with cheddar, then bakes until the top is golden and set. The sauce must be thicker than you think before it goes in: it will loosen as the pasta releases starch during baking."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
